  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-exam-predictor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#SoftwareAgent> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-exam-predictor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "organism-design/exam/predict.mjs: emits present/absent predictions for a held-out roster from Uberon taxon constraints alone." .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-exam-predictor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "organism-design/exam/predict.mjs" .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-organism-exam-predictor> <https://schema.org/codeRepository> <https://github.com/fractastical/delphi> .
}
